    "detailed_description": "Relumine is a puzzle adventure game. A child delves into an abandoned mine and discovers a magic crystal. With the crystal\u2019s power to rotate the world, she explores the ruins of an ancient society, is chased by a giant shadow and guided by mysterious spirits, in search of her long lost Papa. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752220/extras/8d509cd89e763c40bd166e09bfe6e679.avif?t=1667275251\" /></div><br><br>\u2666 Explore 5 mystical portions of the ancient mine, with dozens of puzzles to solve.<br><br>\u2666 Unique Rubik's Cube like mechanic and level design that blends gameplay with storytelling, allowing the player to learn about the world while they play. <br><br>\u2666 Discover magic and unravel the mysteries of the unknown, as Relumine presents an alternate perspective of the world, as seen through a child\u2019s eyes.",
