    "reviews": "\u201cSolving Relumine\u2019s curious puzzles takes a shift in perspective. Rotate this strange world to ascend and descend platforms in an abandoned mine filled with curious crystals, mysterious spirits, and a giant shadow in hot pursuit. Stuck? Make sure you\u2019re standing in the right place before you twist!\u201d<br>App Store<br><br>\u201cThe weekend is approaching, and for many there is also a little time to relax and play a game from the App Store. Anyone who is enthusiastic about puzzle games and adventures will find a suitable new release in Relumine.\u201d<br><br><br>\u201cRelumine is an inviting game that is easy to play and utterly enchanting in its otherworldliness, helping its player to escape into a soothing world of puzzle's and fun.\u201d<br>Pocket Gamer<br>",
